@ 29.1.1.1.13 - Proto-Athabaskan to Hupa
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Sapir, Edward (1936), ”Reflexes of Proto-Athabaskan in Several Languages (Hupa, Navaho, Chipewyan, Sarcee)”
